-    "one_sentence": "No FET-family fusion protein has been shown to BIND a chaperone in any published assay: what the literature contains is three independent demonstrations that EWS::FLI1 protein levels FALL when the HSP90 machine is perturbed — one of them a genetic knockdown of the HSP90 co-chaperone SGT1/SUGT1 rather than a drug — which is chaperone-machine DEPENDENCE and not client status; for EWSR1::NR4A3, this programme's own fusion, the chaperone literature is empty.",
