       "d_fusion_driven_line_sensitive_to_an_HSP90_inhibitor": "ABUNDANT, AND IT IS THE WEAKEST CATEGORY. Ewing and myxoid liposarcoma lines and xenografts are sensitive to 17-AAG, 17-DMAG, ganetespib, PU-H71 and an HSP90 C-terminal-domain inhibitor. Sensitivity of a fusion-driven line is not clientship of the fusion — in the one Ewing paper that actually assayed physical HSP90 interaction (PMID 18676850), the clients named are AKT, KIT and IGF1R, and the fusion is not among them.",
